@startuml TRADES
' Booking a buy trade and counting it into the segregation report of its
' business day is one event, so the two instances take it together.
state "稼働中" as running
running : buys ; 約定ID ⇸ Buy
running : cycles ; 基準日 ⇸ Cycle

[*] --> running : buys と cycles は空

promote local/BUY.puml as Buy via buys(約定ID)
promote local/CYCLE.puml as Cycle via cycles(基準日)

sync BOOK : buys(約定ID), cycles(基準日)

constrain BUY(約定ID, 数量) ; 数量 は最小取引単位の倍数である
constrain BOOK(約定ID, 基準日, 数量) ; 基準日 は 約定ID の約定日である
@enduml
